                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     █
     Reward identity: Each cumulative field is parent + this block’s accounting.BlockFacts via addChecked. Per-block facts already satisfy the identity, so the cumulative form holds by construction.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               █
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     █
     UTXO identity: Independently: U = C - F - E.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    █
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     █
     • Genesis: all outputs are in both C and E → U = 0. Matches Core never connecting genesis.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      █
     • Normal fees: spend shrinks UTXO by F; miner coinbase puts F back inside C; subtracting F once is required. Full-claim two-block case: U = 2 * subsidy.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        █
     • Underclaim: uses actual coinbase, not subsidy+fees. Unclaimed never enters U. U = subsidy - unclaimed - E.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    █
     • OP_RETURN: value sits in C (if coinbase) and in E. Fee still includes that output. Net ΔU = -F - E_tx.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        █
     • Oversized script: same as OP_RETURN; length-only, first byte not 0x6a.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        █
     • Spent outputs: cancel in the telescope; they do not appear in C, F, or E as a third term.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     █
     • No-address outputs: still create utxo_state if spendable; counted in U, not E.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                █
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     █
